DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Hallöchen!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Ich habe auch
mal hier in dieser Stadt gewohnt.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Ich heiße {{TAG:0005:0001:}}, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}It's so nice to visit my old haunts.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}If I come here right before I leave
town,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I smile the whole way home.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Eski uğrak yerlerimi görmek ne güzel.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Kasabadan ayrılmadan hemen önce buraya
uğrarsam,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} eve kadar yüzüm gülüyor.
